{"data": [{"author_id": "2035018650965745664", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:51:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117087087472288247"], "id": "2117087087472288247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 602, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "开盘第一个小时，部分宽基ETF显著放量，中证1000ETF南方（512100）成交额近44亿元，超出上一日全天成交额，科创50ETF华夏（588000）、创业板ETF易方达（159915）、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞（510300）成交额均超50亿元。拉宽基依然是托而不举。", "url": "https://x.com/wolf200131313/status/2117087087472288247"}, {"author_id": "2046490815967657984", "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:22:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117094906846224587"], "id": "2117094906846224587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 942, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "在会议利好刺激下算是稳住了（看持续性），但涨幅榜上是“白酒、消费”居前，工行继续新高，说明资金不太认为市场就此翻转，", "url": "https://x.com/luluai239/status/2117094906846224587"}, {"author_id": "1731412225879859200", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:04:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117120595611754709"], "id": "2117120595611754709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 287, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "利好！大利好！\n提前动手了，这次大概率是来真的了。\n抄底的股民朋友们，终于要迎来吃肉行情了。\n\n上午10点16分，一则财联社盯盘数据显示，多只宽基ETF就显著放量了，中证1000ETF南方才一个小时左右成交金额就超过上一日全天，科创500 https://t.co/kUzGONLhGx", "url": "https://x.com/LogicDensity/status/2117120595611754709"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:42:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117084886540709923"], "id": "2117084886540709923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 917, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 开盘速报 | 11.2 高开反弹，但涨的不是你手里的票\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2117084886540709923"}, {"author_id": "2851487822", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:07:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117106202916127057"]